  "why": "All ten consumed meshes are taken from motoman_config, which the package does not list as a dependency (package.xml:38-43) and whose own manifest marks it deprecated, 'will be removed in ROS Indigo' (motoman_config/package.xml:15-18), the distro of this task. The package ships byte-identical copies under meshes/sia5d/ that its URDF never references, while every other support package in the snapshot (mh5, sia10d, sia10f, sia20d, sda10f) already points at its own meshes. This looks like an incomplete migration: the references resolve only while the deprecated package is present."
 },
